      "4. Weighted reward selection"
      "5. Unique IP allocation (collision-checked, RFC 5737)"
      "6. Network + GameServer chain, linear topology, darknet faction"
      "7. ServerLinks (chain with hidden link types)"
      "8. plantClueFiles() — hidden .signal/trace_N.dat per hop pointing to next IP. Beyond hop 2 = encrypted."
      "9. populateServerContent() — AI lore via DARKNET_SERVER_THEMES + CRYPTIC_QUOTES per depth"
      "10. plantVaultReward() — vault_payload.enc on final server"
